WEBVTT

00:07:58.876 --> 00:08:01.836
A study has put the cost
of protecting 30 percent of the planet

00:08:01.836 --> 00:08:04.636
at about 140 billion dollars a year.

00:08:05.596 --> 00:08:07.556
That's only a fraction of the money

00:08:07.596 --> 00:08:09.676
that governments use
to subsidize industries

00:08:09.716 --> 00:08:13.356
that pollute our air, waste our soil
and empty our ocean.

00:08:13.956 --> 00:08:16.716
We need to reverse the flow of that money

00:08:16.756 --> 00:08:19.916
from funding the destruction
of our life support system

00:08:19.956 --> 00:08:21.316
to preserving it.

00:08:22.076 --> 00:08:24.076
The solution to the problem
we have created

00:08:24.116 --> 00:08:25.996
has been here all along.

00:08:26.036 --> 00:08:29.476
I understand that the idea of protecting
a third of our land and ocean

00:08:29.516 --> 00:08:31.036
may feel threatening to those